WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.289 --> 00:00:01.216
- [Voiceover] Let's talk about your hair.

00:00:01.216 --> 00:00:02.056
- My hair.

00:00:02.056 --> 00:00:03.156
- [Voiceover] We're not
washing our hair for a week.

00:00:03.156 --> 00:00:04.050
(laughing)

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.716
- Ah--
- [Daysha] I'm crying.

00:00:05.716 --> 00:00:06.549
- [Voiceover] Why are we doing this?

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:07.725
What is--
- Why are we doing this?

00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:08.737
(laughing)

00:00:08.737 --> 00:00:11.987
(upbeat, quirky music)

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:30.242
I basically don't shampoo
my hair most times already,

00:00:30.242 --> 00:00:32.994
so, I think I'm good on this challenge.

00:00:32.994 --> 00:00:33.955
- [Voiceover] Yeah, I think we're good.

00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:34.996
- [Voiceover] Great, great.
- [Voiceover] Cut.

00:00:34.996 --> 00:00:36.437
- Apparently if you don't wash your hair

00:00:36.437 --> 00:00:39.819
some people say that their
hair is like better moisturized

00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:42.429
or, you know, it looks shinier, maybe,

00:00:42.429 --> 00:00:44.324
because sometimes shampoos
can be sort of harsh

00:00:44.324 --> 00:00:45.771
and they can dry out your hair.

00:00:45.771 --> 00:00:47.265
- [Voiceover] Do you have
any social obligations

00:00:47.265 --> 00:00:48.098
that you're concerned about?

00:00:48.098 --> 00:00:49.969
- Yeah, I have some
social obligations here.

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:53.154
I mean, one, being a
normal human, that's out.

00:00:53.154 --> 00:00:55.702
Two, I just flicked off
the camera (laughs).

00:00:55.702 --> 00:00:58.251
- I'm afraid my hair's gonna
get real greasy and gross.

00:00:58.251 --> 00:01:00.454
- I think I'm going to
to be looking pretty ugly

00:01:00.454 --> 00:01:03.537
come like tomorrow, Friday, Saturday,

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:05.962
like it's gonna be interesting.

00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:07.545
- It's day two of no shampooing.

00:01:07.545 --> 00:01:09.073
I think my hair looks crazy.

00:01:09.073 --> 00:01:11.731
- This is day three of not washing my hair

00:01:11.731 --> 00:01:13.564
and yeah, there it is.

00:01:15.094 --> 00:01:17.229
It just feels bad,

00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:18.346
like when I lay on a pillow.

00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:20.797
- I'm at the beach, it's a beautiful day.

00:01:20.797 --> 00:01:22.993
After this my hair is
just gonna be disgusting.

00:01:22.993 --> 00:01:24.888
I honestly don't know
if I'm gonna make it.

00:01:24.888 --> 00:01:26.404
- Looks real flat in the back.

00:01:26.404 --> 00:01:27.434
I think people could see

00:01:27.434 --> 00:01:28.886
that maybe I've got a real flat head.

00:01:28.886 --> 00:01:30.365
- I look like a god(bleep) candle.

00:01:30.365 --> 00:01:32.214
I imagine it doesn't
smell that great either.

00:01:32.214 --> 00:01:33.640
(sniffing)
I don't like it.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.176
- Yeah, it doesn't smell good.

00:01:35.176 --> 00:01:37.992
- Oh, (bleep) that is pungent.

00:01:37.992 --> 00:01:39.145
- Look how greasy it looks,

00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:40.044
like it looks wet.

00:01:40.044 --> 00:01:42.135
- Mine's not as greasy
as I thought it would be.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.409
- All I wanna do is use some dry shampoo.

00:01:44.409 --> 00:01:46.826
Why are you doing this to me?

00:01:48.166 --> 00:01:50.518
This was really, really hard. (laughs)

00:01:50.518 --> 00:01:52.224
- My hair doesn't smell as
much as I thought it would

00:01:52.224 --> 00:01:53.751
but it's not pleasant.

00:01:53.751 --> 00:01:54.584
- It smells like (bleep).

00:01:54.584 --> 00:01:56.735
- The first couple days
of not washing my hair

00:01:56.735 --> 00:01:58.062
I actually kind of liked.

00:01:58.062 --> 00:02:00.145
But, as the week went on,

00:02:01.055 --> 00:02:02.001
it was just chaos.

00:02:02.001 --> 00:02:03.521
- I just feel disgusting.

00:02:03.521 --> 00:02:04.869
My hair looks like it's wet

00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:05.967
even though it's not.

00:02:05.967 --> 00:02:09.110
- Every morning I woke up
with a weird hairstyle.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.939
- I think maybe if I'd done
it for longer than a week

00:02:10.939 --> 00:02:13.332
my body would have figured
out what was going on

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.312
and tried to naturally
compensate or something.

00:02:15.312 --> 00:02:17.756
But after a week, it's just trash.

00:02:17.756 --> 00:02:19.202
A big pile of trash up here.

00:02:19.202 --> 00:02:21.780
So, you know, I don't recommend it.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:25.947
(upbeat, twinkling music)
(ethereal vocal tones)

